"notitie in de chatter te plaatsen."

#: ../../content/applications/studio/automated_actions.rst:272
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Note only`: to only post the message as an internal note in the "
"chatter."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Alleen notitie`: bericht alleen als interne notitie in de chatter "
"plaatsen."

