"The header displays the company's :ref:`logo <studio/pdf-reports/default-"
"layout/logo>`, :ref:`tagline <studio/pdf-reports/default-layout/tagline>`, "
"and :ref:`details <studio/pdf-reports/default-layout/details>`."
